     "content_html": "<p>To find <i>A</i> or <i>B</i>, find <span data-math=\"A \\cup B\"></span>. The union of two sets includes all the members of the first set and all the members of the second set. Do not list duplicates twice.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"A\\;{\\rm{or}}\\;B = A \\cup B = \\left\\{ {h,a,p,y,w,e,s,o,m} \\right\\}\"></span></p>"
