     "content_html": "<p>To find <i>A</i> and <i>C</i>, find <span data-math=\"A \\cap C\"></span>. The intersection of two sets includes the elements that are in both sets.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"A\\;{\\rm{and}}\\;C = A \\cap C = \\left\\{ {a,h} \\right\\}\"></span></p>"
