     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>To find <i>B</i> or <i>C</i>, find <span data-math=\"B \\cup C\"></span>. The union of two sets includes all the members of the first set and all the members of the second set. Do not list duplicates twice.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"B\\;{\\rm{or}}\\;C = B \\cup C = \\left\\{ {a,w,e,s,o,m,t,h} \\right\\}\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
